","text":"でっかいどー！どーーーんっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北海道チームは、まいやん、ゆったん、私の3人(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雪を見てはしゃぎ、時計台の前を通ってはしゃぎ、美味しいものを食べてはしゃぎ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まるで修学旅行生かのように3人で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はしゃいでました（笑）楽しかったなー～(＾Д＾～)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/01/15/1890131/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北海道新聞のキャラクター、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぶんちゃんのマネをしてパシャリ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ピース笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぶんちゃんの足下の倒れこんでるやつが気になり過ぎて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/01/15/1890131/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ピンショット撮っといたよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2日間で、新聞、テレビ、ラジオ、イベントと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山 出させて頂きました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北海道の皆さんは、放送や掲載をお楽しみに！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/01/15/1890131/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/01/15/1890131/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},